te=6ea7333297b3209a\" title=\"27-df-vectorinterpretation\">27-df-vectorinterpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c\" href=\"?note=9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c\" title=\"27-thm-hornfunctional\">27-thm-hornfunctional</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc13515b6202f2b3\" href=\"?note=fc13515b6202f2b3\" title=\"27-thm-affinechar\">27-thm-affinechar</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.1 Theorem 11.1; §11.2 Example 11.5; §11.3.1 Equation (11.4); §2.10.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"488,491,110"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"512,515,134"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-checked-with-local-affine-equation-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\geq1\">\\(r\\geq1\\)</span> 为整数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{FEq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_n\">\\(\\models_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^{(r)}\">\\(X_i^{(r)}\\)</span> 及语法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee\">\\(\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c\" href=\"?note=9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c\" title=\"27-thm-hornfunctional\">27-thm-hornfunctional</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fc13515b6202f2b3\" href=\"?note=fc13515b6202f2b3\" title=\"27-thm-affinechar\">27-thm-affinechar</a>。有限语法析取由下节递归构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_s\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_s\\rangle\\)</span> 代表以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[s]\">\\([s]\\)</span> 为域的表达式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\tau_1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\tau_1\\rangle\\)</span> 是长度为1的序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{r,1}\\coloneqq X_1^{(r)},\\qquad A_{r,k+1}\\coloneqq A_{r,k}\\vee X_{k+1}^{(r)}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ 1\\le k&lt;r),\\qquad A_r\\coloneqq A_{r,r}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{r,1}\\coloneqq X_1^{(r)},\\qquad A_{r,k+1}\\coloneqq A_{r,k}\\vee X_{k+1}^{(r)}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ 1\\le k&lt;r),\\qquad A_r\\coloneqq A_{r,r}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\boxplus F\\coloneqq(E\\wedge\\neg F)\\vee(\\neg E\\wedge F)\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r),\\qquad\\xi\\coloneqq(X_1^{(3)}\\boxplus X_2^{(3)})\\boxplus X_3^{(3)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\boxplus F\\coloneqq(E\\wedge\\neg F)\\vee(\\neg E\\wedge F)\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r),\\qquad\\xi\\coloneqq(X_1^{(3)}\\boxplus X_2^{(3)})\\boxplus X_3^{(3)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_+\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,\\left\\langle2,A_2,\\langle X_1^{(2)},X_1^{(2)}\\vee X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle1,A_1,\\langle X_1^{(2)}\\vee X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_+\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,\\left\\langle2,A_2,\\langle X_1^{(2)},X_1^{(2)}\\vee X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle1,A_1,\\langle X_1^{(2)}\\vee X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_H\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,\\left\\langle3,A_3,\\langle X_1^{(2)}\\wedge X_2^{(2)},X_1^{(2)},X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle2,A_2,\\langle X_1^{(2)},X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_H\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,\\left\\langle3,A_3,\\langle X_1^{(2)}\\wedge X_2^{(2)},X_1^{(2)},X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle2,A_2,\\langle X_1^{(2)},X_2^{(2)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_A\\coloneqq\\left\\langle3,\\left\\langle4,A_4,\\langle\\xi,X_1^{(3)},X_2^{(3)},X_3^{(3)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle3,A_3,\\langle X_1^{(3)},X_2^{(3)},X_3^{(3)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_A\\coloneqq\\left\\langle3,\\left\\langle4,A_4,\\langle\\xi,X_1^{(3)},X_2^{(3)},X_3^{(3)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\left\\langle3,A_3,\\langle X_1^{(3)},X_2^{(3)},X_3^{(3)}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_+,e_H,e_A\\in\\mathrm{FEq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_+,e_H,e_A\\in\\mathrm{FEq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_+.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_+.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow f\\models_n e_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>positive 部分对应 Theorem 11.1 和 Example 11.5：e₊ 展开为 f(X)∨f(X∨Y)=f(X∨Y)。若 f 递增，该式由 X≤X∨Y 得出；反向对 X≤Y 用 X∨Y=Y。Horn 部分是原书 (11.4) 的 C∨D=D 形式，展开为 f(X∧Y)∨f(X)∨f(Y)=f(X)∨f(Y)，复用已核对的 FALSE 点交闭判据。</p>\n<p>affine 部分是本地推导，不冒称第11章的编号定理：e_A 展开为 f(X⊕Y⊕Z)∨f(X)∨f(Y)∨f(Z)=f(X)∨f(Y)∨f(Z)，恰排除三个假点的 xor 为真；按已有 affine FALSE 集三元 xor 闭包定理等价于原书 §2.10.3 的线性方程组解集类。这里 affine 不是单个输出仿射线性式，书中 §11.3.2 的 linear 又是 DNF 度≤1，两者均未混用。</p>\n<p>每个对象均显式列出内层表达式序列、外层表达式及共享向量元数；单项序列按 [1] 编码。n=0 时两种常函数均满足三个方程，与三个类的本地零元约定一致。原书出处为印刷 pp.488,491,110／PDF pp.512,515,134；原书陈述和本地转换分别记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-functionalequation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vectorinterpretation","status":"resolved","id":"6ea7333297b3209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornfunctional","status":"resolved","id":"9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornfunctional]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-affinechar","status":"resolved","id":"fc13515b6202f2b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"",